Title:
Task 01: Data Visualization using Bar Chart

Objective:
To create a bar chart to visualize the distribution of population data.

Dataset Description:
The dataset contains country-wise population information from the World Bank dataset. The 2022 population column is used for visualization.

Tools Used:

Python
Pandas
Matplotlib
Jupyter Notebook / VS Code

Methodology:

Imported the dataset.
Cleaned missing values.
Selected country names and population values.
Sorted data based on population.
Created a bar chart.
